        "race": "white",
        "text": "no_text",
        "text_relationship": "no_text",
        "behaviour": "The person is kneeling beside an oven, smiling warmly as they appear to be engaged in cooking or baking, possibly checking on food inside the oven. Their posture suggests attentiveness and care towards the task at hand, indicating a sense of enjoyment or pride in preparing a meal. The expression conveys satisfaction and perhaps anticipation of the results, hinting at a motivation driven by either personal pleasure in cooking or the desire to prepare something special for others. The surrounding kitchen environment, filled with various utensils and ingredients, further supports the idea that this individual is actively involved in a culinary activity, likely aiming to create a delicious dish.",
